## United States government records

The catalog spreadsheets in `sources/catalog/`, the official descriptions quoted on each record page, and the press-release extracts in `sources/press/` are U.S. government works. They are in the public domain in the United States and are not restricted by the CC BY or MIT terms above. See [17 U.S.C. § 105](https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/USCODE-2023-title17/html/USCODE-2023-title17-chap1-sec105.htm).

Quotations from those records are included so the archive can be searched. They are not a claim of copyright in the government's words.

Press articles, advocate posts, and skeptic essays are not copied here. They are linked, and any paraphrase is labeled.
